    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/8096c0c38ed20752a71359cf9ea61fde.poster.avif?t=1753230600\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/8096c0c38ed20752a71359cf9ea61fde.webm?t=1753230600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/8096c0c38ed20752a71359cf9ea61fde.mp4?t=1753230600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Different Monsters</strong>, with unique behaviors-abilities. Even some of them hit to towers !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ Different Cards</strong>, each with strong buffs and debuffs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Unique Maps with 5 different biomes</strong>, each with distinct environments and paths,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Versatile Towers</strong>, each feauturing unique attack patterns,abilities and health,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player,</strong> a hero you control to help your towers defend against difficult monsters,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Tree Upgrading</strong>, allowing you to enhance both your hero and towers,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VFX,</strong>\u00a0including glowing elements using special shaders and particles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/c872936b35cbaabf51de0913659cd941.poster.avif?t=1753230600\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/c872936b35cbaabf51de0913659cd941.webm?t=1753230600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/c872936b35cbaabf51de0913659cd941.mp4?t=1753230600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/8096c0c38ed20752a71359cf9ea61fde.poster.avif?t=1753230600\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/8096c0c38ed20752a71359cf9ea61fde.webm?t=1753230600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/8096c0c38ed20752a71359cf9ea61fde.mp4?t=1753230600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Different Monsters</strong>, with unique behaviors-abilities. Even some of them hit to towers !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ Different Cards</strong>, each with strong buffs and debuffs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Unique Maps with 5 different biomes</strong>, each with distinct environments and paths,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Versatile Towers</strong>, each feauturing unique attack patterns,abilities and health,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player,</strong> a hero you control to help your towers defend against difficult monsters,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Tree Upgrading</strong>, allowing you to enhance both your hero and towers,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VFX,</strong>\u00a0including glowing elements using special shaders and particles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/c872936b35cbaabf51de0913659cd941.poster.avif?t=1753230600\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/c872936b35cbaabf51de0913659cd941.webm?t=1753230600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522130/extras/c872936b35cbaabf51de0913659cd941.mp4?t=1753230600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
